{
  "_note": "Mutation cases for the prior-art lint tests. Each case copies matrix_pass.json (matrix_cases) or query_log_pass.json (query_log_cases), applies its ops in order, renders the result as Markdown with the listed render flags, and lints it. expect_ok true means the lint must accept the document; otherwise every item of expect must be among the errors. Cell ops: set (field, value), set_repeat (field, unit, count), append (field, value), wrap (field, open, close), remove_cell, remove_system, rename_system (value is the new name), duplicate_cell. Query ops: keep_first (count), drop_source (source), set_row (index, field, value). Render flags: crlf, reverse, decoy, no_table, bad_header, raw_row:<line appended below the table>. All URLs use the reserved example.com host.",
